  "published": "1900-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Logger.GetPdfAuditTrail gains an optional maxRows parameter that caps the number of\n\t\t\tGLOBAL rows included in the PDF (keeping the most recent per the sort contract);\n\t\t\tignored for per-document exports.\n\n\t\t\tLogger.ListEvents excludes SDSDocumentElementEvent's TYP range directly instead of\n\t\t\tanti-joining DocumentEventLog per row, cutting query cost on the global audit\n\t\t\tgrid/PDF.\n\n\t\t\tAdds a supporting composite (Timestamp, Ticks) index for the global audit\n\t\t\tlist/count, plus a DBA rollout kit (Oracle/PostgreSQL DDL, health checks).",
